 955          *  USBFS_OUT_BUFFER_EMPTY |The OUT endpoint is set to ACK OUT and is waiting for data
 956          *  USBFS_OUT_BUFFER_FULL  |An OUT transaction has occurred and data can be read
 957          *
 958          *******************************************************************************/
